From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 10 May 2026 18:08:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/15] feat(library): show PDF as default view when opening a
 resume

Opening a resume from the library now shows the actual PDF first
instead of jumping straight into the text editor. A tab bar (PDF |
Edit | ATS check | Analysis) lets users switch between views; PDF is
the default when a pdf_url exists. ResumeView now manages its own
scroll areas rather than relying on the parent ScrollPane.

https://claude.ai/code/session_015ED4ARZAgLY1ww81cRfeDs
