Subject: [PATCH 07/15] feat(suggest): reuse JD research on repeat coach; fuzzy
 apply accepts

Suggest endpoints accept reuse_research_digest (and optional queries/sources) to skip a second live web search when the client re-runs the coach for the same JD. ResumeBuilder stores the last research bundle in a ref and sends it on the next Get suggestions. Structured PDF apply now uses the same fuzzy line matching as the preview for skills/experience bullets, with prefix fallback for experience when needed.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
