Subject: [PATCH 08/15] feat(resume): PDF hierarchy for education and projects

Add EducationItem and ProjectItem to the structured doc model. Education renders as subheadings (dates/location split from degree) instead of one comma-joined bullet. Projects use one title per project with multiple bullets, including grouping of legacy Name:-prefixed lines. Accepted-edit paths and Jinja templates (Harshibar + classic) follow the new fields.

