From 420098d365b29fd74325a785e6f08d4addde5498 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 18 May 2026 03:33:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/15] feat(analyze): bullet edit flow + reusable
 /api/rewrite-bullet endpoint
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bullet state machine (3 states per bullet in Analyze view):
  idle → expanded → [Accept AI] → accepted (green badge, editable)
                  → [Edit AI draft] → editing textarea (pre-filled)
                  → [Write my own] → editing textarea (blank)
  accepted → [Edit] → editing | [Undo] → idle

Store changes (resumeAnalyzeStore):
  - acceptedBullets: Record<number, "ai" | "custom"> tracks formal acceptance
  - acceptBullet(index, text, kind) — sets lineOverride + marks accepted
  - unacceptBullet(index) — clears both

