Backend:
- _llm_tailor_to_jd(doc, jd, role, company): re-tailor an extracted model to a specific JD without re-extracting; patches summary + bullets, falls back to original on LLM error
- _doc_from_structured_dict(structured, accepted_edits): rebuild ResumeDocModel from structuredResume JSON with bullet-level patches applied
- POST /api/analyze-export-pdf: dict → patch → optional JD tailor → Jinja2/LaTeX → pdflatex → PDF download; same template pipeline as Tailor
- Route registered alongside /api/export-docx

Frontend:
- useAnalyzeExport hook: reads structuredResume + bulletMap + acceptedBullets from store, builds acceptedEdits map, calls /api/analyze-export-pdf or /api/export-docx, triggers browser download
- AnalyzePreviewPane: wires useAnalyzeExport with jd prop, passes onExportPdf/onExportDocx/exportingResume to AnnotatedResumePanel
- AnnotatedResumePanel: accepts export callbacks, renders "Export PDF" + "Export DOCX" buttons in presentation-only toolbar (right of existing template picker); buttons disabled while exporting
- AnalyzeResume: passes jd to AnalyzePreviewPane

